msgid "Paste the filter string from the Windows DCV client (dcvusblist.exe) and Parse to fields, or fill the fields directly, then Add to staging. Format: Name,BaseClass,SubClass,Protocol,VID,PID,Autoshare,SkipReset. Use * as a wildcard. Class/VID/PID are DECIMAL -- exactly as the DCV client's Copy filter string produces them. Hex input with a 0x prefix (e.g. 0x1050) is accepted and auto-converted to decimal."
